# Auto-request review on release-please's release PRs: every release PR
# rewrites these three files (and, per AGENTS.md, nothing else may touch
# them), so owning them requests a review from the release owner exactly
# when a release PR opens, with no effect on ordinary skill PRs.
/CHANGELOG.md @hervenivon
/version.txt @hervenivon
/.release-please-manifest.json @hervenivon

# The release machinery itself. A change here redefines what a release is,
# what lands in the notes, or where they are published, so it gets the same
# review as the release PRs it produces.
/release-please-config.json @hervenivon
/.github/workflows/release-please.yml @hervenivon
/.github/workflows/publish-changelog.yml @hervenivon
/.github/CODEOWNERS @hervenivon
